<title>SRI LANKA: Forbes up on merger market talk.</title>
<headline>Forbes up on merger market talk.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forbes Ceylon Ltd was up 4.3 percent, or 25 cents, to six rupees on Thursday on market talk of a merger, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is full of rumours of a merger between Forbes and Vanik, which is driving up the price,&quot; said a local broker, who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Vanik Inc Ltd is an investment bank.</p>
<p>The scrip closed 50 cents up on Wednesday on turnover of about 450,000 shares, on the same rumours, he said.</p>
<p>Forbes Ceylon is a diversified holding company.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
